{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42627","headline":"题建造寺 · 王继勳","name":"题建造寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾看画图劳健羡，如今亲见画犹麄。\n减除天半石初泐，欠却几株松未枯。\n题像阁人渔浦叟，集生台鸟谢城乌。\n我来一听支公论，自是吾身幻得吾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王继勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}